@baseUrl = https://booknest-api-3jl3.onrender.com
@accessToken = paste-access-token
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token

### Login — fill using the local ignored demo credential file
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"figma.reader.20261017@example.invalid","password":"replace-with-demo-password"}

### Signup — use your own account details; compare Confirm Password in the app
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Your Reader Name","email":"your-own-email@example.com","password":"replace-with-your-password-12-or-more-characters"}

### Profile — same access token as every private API below
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### My Books
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screens/library?tab=all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Continue Reading
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screens/library?tab=reading
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Notes screen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screens/library?tab=notes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screens/collections?tab=all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh — replace both stored tokens with this response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Home — public
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/home
